  "overview": "Astryx — Crisp light (#ffffff) canvas, Figtree typography, #0a7d55 brand accent, and 8px corner geometry",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Dark (#ff0000) canvas paired with `#ff0000` component surfaces and `#f7f7f8` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#0a7d55` with `#f7f7f8` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `Figtree` across 15 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
